{"unit_id":"yoursc__dsh-siyuan#card-zh","repo":"yoursc/dsh-siyuan","commit":"e1889e6518e7f21400a30f77747edd13d02de876","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"SiYuan Notes 是把思源笔记接入 DSH Web 的插件：它在宿主注册 siyuan_* 工具，并提供独立设置页管理连接、凭据、默认笔记本与逐工具开关。模型可搜索笔记、查询只读 SQL、读取文档和块，也可创建、追加、插入、更新、移动与重命名内容，读写指定日期的日记，并按需删除块或文档。工具分只读、写入、日记和危险组，写入与删除默认关闭。适合希望在 DSH 对话中查阅或维护思源知识库的用户；需要配置可访问的思源地址，API token 可选，页面把 token 状态交给宿主凭据库管理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:793-1211","lib/client.js:4-7"]}
{"unit_id":"yoursc__dsh-siyuan#card-en","repo":"yoursc/dsh-siyuan","commit":"e1889e6518e7f21400a30f77747edd13d02de876","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"SiYuan Notes connects SiYuan to DSH Web. Tools search notes, read documents, run read-only SQL, edit content, and handle daily notes. A settings page manages the connection, token, notebook, and tool switches. Writing and deletion are off by default. Configure a reachable SiYuan address.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:793-1211","lib/client.js:4-7"]}
