{"unit_id":"yoursc__dsh-siyuan#feature-1","repo":"yoursc/dsh-siyuan","commit":"e1889e6518e7f21400a30f77747edd13d02de876","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"SiYuan Notes 的功能「search」：思源笔记的全文检索：调用 siyuan_search 查询笔记并返回命中块、文档 id、人类路径与高亮片段，便于继续读取对应文档。 通过对应的 search操作完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:817-830"]}
{"unit_id":"yoursc__dsh-siyuan#feature-2","repo":"yoursc/dsh-siyuan","commit":"e1889e6518e7f21400a30f77747edd13d02de876","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"SiYuan Notes 的功能「read」：思源文档与块读取：按 id 读取纯文本、Markdown 或原始 DOM，也可列出路径下文档、直接子块和块属性。 通过对应的 read操作完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:861-952"]}
{"unit_id":"yoursc__dsh-siyuan#feature-3","repo":"yoursc/dsh-siyuan","commit":"e1889e6518e7f21400a30f77747edd13d02de876","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"SiYuan Notes 的功能「write」：思源文档编辑：可按路径新建文档、向文档末尾追加 Markdown、在块后插入内容、更新块、设置属性、移动或重命名文档。 通过对应的 write操作完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:958-1115"]}
{"unit_id":"yoursc__dsh-siyuan#feature-4","repo":"yoursc/dsh-siyuan","commit":"e1889e6518e7f21400a30f77747edd13d02de876","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"SiYuan Notes 的功能「daily」：思源日记读写：按指定日期（默认今天）读取日记或追加 Markdown；日记不存在时按笔记本的保存路径创建。 通过对应的 daily操作完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1122-1156"]}
{"unit_id":"yoursc__dsh-siyuan#feature-5","repo":"yoursc/dsh-siyuan","commit":"e1889e6518e7f21400a30f77747edd13d02de876","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"SiYuan Notes 的功能「settings」：思源连接设置页：在 DSH Web 设置地址、token、默认笔记本，并单独启停各工具；保存工具开关后即时重新注册。 通过对应的 设置页操作完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4-7"]}
{"unit_id":"yoursc__dsh-siyuan#caveat-1","repo":"yoursc/dsh-siyuan","commit":"e1889e6518e7f21400a30f77747edd13d02de876","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"SiYuan Notes 使用配置的思源地址发送笔记检索和读写请求；地址默认是本机 6806 端口，跨主机部署需填写 DSH 可访问的地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:30"]}
{"unit_id":"yoursc__dsh-siyuan#caveat-2","repo":"yoursc/dsh-siyuan","commit":"e1889e6518e7f21400a30f77747edd13d02de876","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"SiYuan Notes 的 API token 可由 SIYUAN_TOKEN 环境变量提供，或交由宿主凭据服务保存；设置页仅呈现来源与配置状态，不回显 token 值。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31"]}
